{"seq":2,"slug":"box-model-and-layout-modes","title":"盒模型与布局模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/box-model-and-layout-modes","wordCount":757,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"盒模型与布局模式\">盒模型与布局模式</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>CSS 中每一个元素都被视为一个矩形的<strong>盒子</strong>。盒模型定义了这个盒子的尺寸如何计算，而格式化上下文（Formatting Context）决定了这些盒子如何在页面上排列。理解这两者是掌握所有 CSS 布局技术的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>盒模型由 <code>content</code>、<code>padding</code>、<code>border</code>、<code>margin</code> 四层由内向外组成，<code>box-sizing</code> 决定 <code>width</code>/<code>height</code> 覆盖到哪一层；格式化上下文则是决定盒子如何排布的独立排版环境——块级上下文（BFC）、行内上下文（IFC）、弹性上下文（FFC）和网格上下文（GFC）各自遵循不同的排布规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;CSS 盒模型&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;content&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;padding&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;border&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;margin&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F{&quot;box-sizing&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;content-box: width = content&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;border-box: width = content + padding + border&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"CSS 盒模型\"] --&gt; B[\"content\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"padding\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"border\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"margin\"]\n    B --&gt; F{\"box-sizing\"}\n    F --&gt; G[\"content-box: width = content\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"border-box: width = content + padding + border\"]</pre><h2 id=\"content-box-vs-border-box\">content-box vs border-box</h2><p>CSS 提供两种盒模型计算方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性值</th>\n<th>width/height 包含</th>\n<th>实际占用宽度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>content-box</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>仅 content</td>\n<td>content + padding + border</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>border-box</code></td>\n<td>content + padding + border</td>\n<td>等于设置的 width</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* content-box（默认） */&#10;.box-content {&#10;  box-sizing: content-box;&#10;  width: 200px;&#10;  padding: 20px;&#10;  border: 2px solid;&#10;  /* 实际宽度 = 200 + 20*2 + 2*2 = 244px */&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* border-box */&#10;.box-border {&#10;  box-sizing: border-box;&#10;  width: 200px;&#10;  padding: 20px;&#10;  border: 2px solid;&#10;  /* 实际宽度 = 200px，content 自动缩小为 156px */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* content-box（默认） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.box-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-sizing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">content-box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 实际宽度 = 200 + 20*2 + 2*2 = 244px */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* border-box */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.box-border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-sizing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">border-box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 实际宽度 = 200px，content 自动缩小为 156px */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 现代开发几乎都使用全局 <code>border-box</code> 重置，避免尺寸计算的心智负担。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"*,&#10;*::before,&#10;*::after {&#10;  box-sizing: border-box;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-sizing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">border-box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"margin-折叠\">margin 折叠</h2><p>垂直方向上相邻的 margin 会发生<strong>折叠（Collapse）</strong>，取两者中较大的值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".paragraph-a {&#10;  margin-bottom: 20px;&#10;}&#10;.paragraph-b {&#10;  margin-top: 30px;&#10;}&#10;/* 两者之间的间距 = max(20, 30) = 30px，而非 50px */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.paragraph-a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-bottom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.paragraph-b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 两者之间的间距 = max(20, 30) = 30px，而非 50px */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>margin 折叠的三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>相邻兄弟元素的上下 margin</li>\n<li>父元素与第一个/最后一个子元素的 margin</li>\n<li>空块级元素的上下 margin</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;折叠前&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;元素A margin-bottom: 20px&quot;]&#10;        GAP[&quot;20px + 30px ?&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;元素B margin-top: 30px&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;折叠后&quot;&#10;        A2[&quot;元素A&quot;]&#10;        REAL[&quot;实际间距 30px&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;元素B&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"折叠前\"\n        A1[\"元素A margin-bottom: 20px\"]\n        GAP[\"20px + 30px ?\"]\n        B1[\"元素B margin-top: 30px\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"折叠后\"\n        A2[\"元素A\"]\n        REAL[\"实际间距 30px\"]\n        B2[\"元素B\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"格式化上下文\">格式化上下文</h2><p>格式化上下文（Formatting Context）是 CSS 布局的核心概念，决定了子元素如何排列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"block-formatting-context-bfc\">Block Formatting Context (BFC)</h3><p>BFC 是一个独立的布局区域，内部元素的布局不影响外部。</p>\n<p>触发 BFC 的条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 以下属性均可创建 BFC */&#10;.bfc-overflow {&#10;  overflow: hidden;&#10;} /* 或 auto / scroll */&#10;.bfc-display {&#10;  display: flow-root;&#10;} /* 专门用于创建 BFC */&#10;.bfc-float {&#10;  float: left;&#10;}&#10;.bfc-position {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;}&#10;.bfc-flex {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;}&#10;.bfc-grid {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 以下属性均可创建 BFC */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-overflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  overflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 或 auto / scroll */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flow-root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 专门用于创建 BFC */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bfc-grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BFC 的实际作用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包含浮动元素</td>\n<td>BFC 会计算浮动子元素的高度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻止 margin 折叠</td>\n<td>BFC 边界不与子元素 margin 折叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防止文字环绕</td>\n<td>BFC 区域不会与浮动元素重叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;div style=&quot;display: flow-root;&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;div style=&quot;float: left; width: 100px; height: 100px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 父容器会正确包含浮动子元素 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"display: flow-root;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"float: left; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 父容器会正确包含浮动子元素 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"inline-formatting-context-ifc\">Inline Formatting Context (IFC)</h3><p>IFC 中元素沿水平方向排列，遵循行盒（line box）规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".inline-demo span {&#10;  /* inline 元素的 width/height 无效 */&#10;  /* 垂直方向的 padding/margin 不影响行高 */&#10;  /* 水平方向的 padding/margin 正常生效 */&#10;  padding: 4px 8px;&#10;  margin: 0 4px;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.inline-demo</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* inline 元素的 width/height 无效 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 垂直方向的 padding/margin 不影响行高 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 水平方向的 padding/margin 正常生效 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"flex-formatting-context\">Flex Formatting Context</h3><p>设置 <code>display: flex</code> 后，子元素成为 flex items，脱离常规流规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".flex-container {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  gap: 16px;&#10;  align-items: center;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.flex-container &gt; * {&#10;  /* 所有子元素自动成为 flex item */&#10;  /* float、clear、vertical-align 失效 */&#10;  /* 可以使用 flex-grow/shrink/basis */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.flex-container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  align-items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.flex-container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 所有子元素自动成为 flex item */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* float、clear、vertical-align 失效 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 可以使用 flex-grow/shrink/basis */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"grid-formatting-context\">Grid Formatting Context</h3><p>设置 <code>display: grid</code> 后，子元素参与网格布局：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".grid-container {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);&#10;  gap: 16px;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.grid-container &gt; * {&#10;  /* 所有子元素自动成为 grid item */&#10;  /* 可以使用 grid-column/grid-row 放置 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid-container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid-container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 所有子元素自动成为 grid item */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 可以使用 grid-column/grid-row 放置 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"四种格式化上下文对比\">四种格式化上下文对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph BFC[&quot;Block Formatting Context&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        B1[&quot;块1&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;块2&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;块3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph IFC[&quot;Inline Formatting Context&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        I1[&quot;行内1&quot;] ~~~ I2[&quot;行内2&quot;] ~~~ I3[&quot;行内3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph FFC[&quot;Flex Formatting Context&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        F1[&quot;弹性1&quot;] ~~~ F2[&quot;弹性2&quot;] ~~~ F3[&quot;弹性3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph GFC[&quot;Grid Formatting Context&quot;]&#10;        G1[&quot;网格1&quot;] ~~~ G2[&quot;网格2&quot;]&#10;        G3[&quot;网格3&quot;] ~~~ G4[&quot;网格4&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph BFC[\"Block Formatting Context\"]\n        direction TB\n        B1[\"块1\"]\n        B2[\"块2\"]\n        B3[\"块3\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph IFC[\"Inline Formatting Context\"]\n        direction LR\n        I1[\"行内1\"] ~~~ I2[\"行内2\"] ~~~ I3[\"行内3\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph FFC[\"Flex Formatting Context\"]\n        direction LR\n        F1[\"弹性1\"] ~~~ F2[\"弹性2\"] ~~~ F3[\"弹性3\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph GFC[\"Grid Formatting Context\"]\n        G1[\"网格1\"] ~~~ G2[\"网格2\"]\n        G3[\"网格3\"] ~~~ G4[\"网格4\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>上下文</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>排列方向</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BFC</td>\n<td><code>flow-root</code>、<code>overflow</code> 等</td>\n<td>垂直</td>\n<td>清除浮动、阻止折叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IFC</td>\n<td>行内元素</td>\n<td>水平</td>\n<td>文字与行内元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flex</td>\n<td><code>display: flex</code></td>\n<td>主轴方向</td>\n<td>一维布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grid</td>\n<td><code>display: grid</code></td>\n<td>行列双向</td>\n<td>二维布局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"display-属性的双值语法\">display 属性的双值语法</h2><p>现代 CSS 使用双值 <code>display</code> 语法区分外部和内部显示类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 外部 block + 内部 flex */&#10;.container {&#10;  display: block flex;&#10;} /* 等价于 display: flex */&#10;&#10;/* 外部 inline + 内部 flex */&#10;.inline-flex {&#10;  display: inline flex;&#10;} /* 等价于 display: inline-flex */&#10;&#10;/* 外部 block + 内部 grid */&#10;.grid {&#10;  display: block grid;&#10;} /* 等价于 display: grid */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 外部 block + 内部 flex */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">block</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 等价于 display: flex */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 外部 inline + 内部 flex */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.inline-flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 等价于 display: inline-flex */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 外部 block + 内部 grid */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">block</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 等价于 display: grid */</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 双值语法让 <code>display</code> 的语义更清晰——第一个值控制元素在父级中的行为（外部），第二个值控制子元素的布局（内部）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSS 盒模型由 content、padding、border、margin 四层构成</li>\n<li><strong><code>border-box</code></strong> 是现代开发的标准选择，让 width/height 直接控制可见尺寸</li>\n<li><strong>margin 折叠</strong>只发生在块级方向（垂直），flex/grid 布局中不会折叠</li>\n<li><strong>BFC</strong> 是独立布局区域，用 <code>display: flow-root</code> 创建最语义化</li>\n<li>四种格式化上下文（BFC/IFC/Flex/Grid）决定子元素的排列规则</li>\n<li><code>display</code> 双值语法将外部类型和内部类型分离，提升可读性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"盒模型与布局模式","id":"盒模型与布局模式"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"content-box vs border-box","id":"content-box-vs-border-box"},{"level":2,"text":"margin 折叠","id":"margin-折叠"},{"level":2,"text":"格式化上下文","id":"格式化上下文"},{"level":3,"text":"Block Formatting Context (BFC)","id":"block-formatting-context-bfc"},{"level":3,"text":"Inline Formatting Context (IFC)","id":"inline-formatting-context-ifc"},{"level":3,"text":"Flex Formatting Context","id":"flex-formatting-context"},{"level":3,"text":"Grid Formatting Context","id":"grid-formatting-context"},{"level":2,"text":"四种格式化上下文对比","id":"四种格式化上下文对比"},{"level":2,"text":"display 属性的双值语法","id":"display-属性的双值语法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"层叠与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/cascade-and-specificity"},"next":{"title":"定位与层叠上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/positioning-and-stacking"}}